  "user": "I'm CUS-0004. Transaction TX-0401, 240.00 EUR: the goods never arrived. Which reason code applies?",
  "answer": "The reason code that matches your situation is **goods_not_received**. Your transaction TX-0401 (EUR 240.00, TechMart Online, 20 July 2026) is a settled card payment on account ACC-1005.\n\nThis code has a 90-day window from the transaction date, so it would run to about 18 October 2026. I have not yet confirmed eligibility, so the window and status still need to be checked.\n\nI also see a second EUR 240.00 payment to TechMart Online, TX-0402, dated 14 July 2026. If you were charged twice for the same order, the duplicate_charge code may apply to that one instead. If you only paid once and the goods never arrived, goods_not_received is the right code for TX-0401.\n\nIf you'd like, I can check eligibility for TX-0401 under goods_not_received. If it is eligible, I can open the dispute once you confirm.",
